# Each miss observed was a whole dispatch (0, or 420 where 480 was due), and in
# the no-reset rows the following iterations read the correct running total
# again -- the dispatch was not lost, it landed after the readback. So the
# CopyResource(staging) + Map(READ) is not ordered after the preceding compute
